Package: aventurine
Version: 1.0-1
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libglib2.0-0
Maintainer: sudo-megas <noreply@github.com>
Description: Screen colour picker
 Picks a colour from the screen through the desktop portal and shows it
 in fourteen formats with contrast ratios and a tint and shade ramp.
